{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://warpmetal.com/contracts/workspace-child-integrator-v1.schema.json",
  "$comment": "Manager-frozen single-target integrator. New exact capability reads preparation2 and base policy2 coding_worker/business_worker/reviewer plus integrator policy3/control4. Failed new validation never falls back. Existing immutable contracts unchanged. Runtime ROOT Producer stages/reads/signs under registered root; Sandbox independently verifies source and before image without signer custody. Same target path must fit both settled author and assigned integrator scopes; no overwrite or path mapping. Schema validation alone supplies no target, financial, installed, native or source-read authority.",
